source_note = "DRAFT placeholder ranges. Real cleaner shrimp are simultaneous hermaphrodites whose larvae need special planktonic rearing to survive — modeled here as a simplified instant-fry livebearer for gameplay consistency with cherry_shrimp, same simplification already applied there. Verify against Seriously Fish / Aquarium Co-Op before shipping real data."
